  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="035f3d36-e5dc-5604-8438-a0bbf221544f" activityNameId="d7b75b9d-52a0-53d2-a5c6-5e482bc65e01" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transistor, SMD type, surface mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transistor, SMD type, surface mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical SMD transistor for surface mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such transistors and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of transistors with a weight of 0.593 gram/unit.; UUID: 9d62b567-b9f3-3a4d-acb0-9218c33a88ce
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used SMD transistors for surface mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of SMD transistors
Technology: average production technology comprising Si-crystal die bonding; wire bonding; encapsulation; plating; triming; forming and marking.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9d62b567-b9f3-3a4d-acb0-9218c33a88ce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
